  "description": "<h1>Infinite Stash</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Virtually Unlimited Storage:</strong> Expands your stash to 10,000 rows (100,000 slots), giving you all the space you will ever need for your loot.</li>\n<li><strong>Safe Uninstallation:</strong> Before removing the mod, ensure all items are moved to the top. If even a single item remains in the expanded area, the extra slots will be deleted, but <strong>only down to the lowest remaining item</strong> in your stash.</li>\n</ul>\n",
